T543	Claim 44209 44261	it's the obligation of the president to do just that
T544	Claim 44267 44284	I intend to do so
T545	Claim 46115 46184	We've seen, in this world, a development of a tremendous threat to us
T546	Claim 48218 48249	it's not just campaign rhetoric
T547	Claim 48251 48314	I think that militarily we are as strong as any nation on earth
T548	Claim 48316 48418	I think we got to stay that way and continue to increase our capabilities to meet any potential threat
T549	Premise 48424 48480	as far as strength derived from commitment to principles
T550	Premise 48482 48542	as far as strength derived from the unity within our country
