T552	Premise 48908 49082	as far as - as strength derived from doing what's right - caring for the poor, providing food, becoming the breadbasket of the world instead of the arms merchant of the world
T553	Claim 49085 49120	in those respects, we're not strong
T554	Claim 49128 49193	we'll never be strong again overseas, unless we're strong at home
